'''Ragnarok''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished from [[Hotspots]] on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Ragnarok''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] on the [[Crimson Isle]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|47}} or higher to be fished up.

