== Behavior ==
The '''Ragnarok''' has two phases.
* Before reaching {{HP|50%}}, the '''Ragnarok''' will jump around the player {{Green|5}} times in a row every {{Green|15s}}{{Confirm}}, rapidly shooting waves of fire and spirals of fire particles that deal immense damage.
* Upon reaching {{HP|50%}}, the '''Ragnarok''' becomes invulnerable for a period of time, summoning lightning strikes around the player.
* When under {{HP|50%}}, the '''Ragnarok''' will perform the same attacks, alongside converting blocks around it into {{ID|Lime Terracotta!{{Green|Lime}}|nolink=yes}}, {{ID|Yellow Terracotta!{{Yellow|Yellow}}|nolink=yes}}, {{ID|Orange Terracotta!{{Gold|Orange}}|nolink=yes}}, and {{ID|Red Terracotta!{{Red|Red}}|nolink=yes}} Terracotta. Players within the area after reaching {{ID|Red Terracotta!{{Red|Red}}|nolink=yes}} take significant damage.

If the '''Ragnarok''' is taken too far from it's original spawn point, about 40-50m, it will despawn. It will also despawn if pushed into the void.

